        <img src="https://s7g10.scene7.com/is/image/BORUSSIADORTMUNDGMBHANDCOKGAA/signal-iduna-park-anreise-oepnv?qlt=85&ts=1787744649148&dpr=off" srcset="https://s7g10.scene7.com/is/image/BORUSSIADORTMUNDGMBHANDCOKGAA/signal-iduna-park-anreise-oepnv?qlt=85&amp;wid=320&amp;ts=1787744649148&amp;dpr=off 320w,https://s7g10.scene7.com/is/image/BORUSSIADORTMUNDGMBHANDCOKGAA/signal-iduna-park-anreise-oepnv?qlt=85&amp;wid=480&amp;ts=1787744649148&amp;dpr=off 480w,https://s7g10.scene7.com/is/image/BORUSSIADORTMUNDGMBHANDCOKGAA/signal-iduna-park-anreise-oepnv?qlt=85&amp;wid=600&amp;ts=1787744649148&amp;dpr=off 600w,https://s7g10.scene7.com/is/image/BORUSSIADORTMUNDGMBHANDCOKGAA/signal-iduna-park-anreise-oepnv?qlt=85&amp;wid=767&amp;ts=1787744649148&amp;dpr=off 767w,https://s7g10.scene7.com/is/image/BORUSSIADORTMUNDGMBHANDCOKGAA/signal-iduna-park-anreise-oepnv?qlt=85&amp;wid=1279&amp;ts=1787744649148&amp;dpr=off 1279w,https://s7g10.scene7.com/is/image/BORUSSIADORTMUNDGMBHANDCOKGAA/signal-iduna-park-anreise-oepnv?qlt=85&amp;wid=1300&amp;ts=1787744649148&amp;dpr=off 1300w,https://s7g10.scene7.com/is/image/BORUSSIADORTMUNDGMBHANDCOKGAA/signal-iduna-park-anreise-oepnv?qlt=85&amp;wid=1440&amp;ts=1787744649148&amp;dpr=off 1440w" loading="lazy" class="cmp-image__image" itemprop="contentUrl" alt="Karte aller Haltestellen rund um den SIGNAL IDUNA PARK und den erweiterten Umkreis."/>
    

        </div>
        
    

    </bvb-image>

    
</div>

        
    </div>

</div>
</div>
